<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GM SCREEN — ANOTHER BUG HUNT</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');

  :root {
    --bg: #f5f5f0;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --panel: #fafaf7;
    --border: #d0d0c8;
    --text: #1a1a1a;
    --dim: #777770;
    --bright: #000000;
    --red: #cc2200;
    --red-dim: rgba(204,34,0,0.08);
    --amber: #b8860b;
    --amber-dim: rgba(184,134,11,0.08);
    --green: #2d7a2d;
    --green-dim: rgba(45,122,45,0.08);
    --blue: #1a5276;
    --blue-dim: rgba(26,82,118,0.08);
    --cyan: #1a5276;
    --cyan-dim: rgba(26,82,118,0.08);
    --caution: #e8c800;
    --caution-dim: rgba(232,200,0,0.12);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* No scanlines in light mode */

  /* ===== HEADER ===== */
  .header {
    background: var(--bright);
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--caution);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .header h1 {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }
  .header .sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #999;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .clock {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--caution);
  }

  /* ===== PARTY COMPOSITION TRACKER ===== */
  .party-tracker {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding: 10px 16px 12px;
  }
  .party-tracker-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .party-tracker-title {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--bright);
  }
  .party-tracker-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .party-btn {
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .party-btn:hover { background: var(--caution-dim); }
  .party-groups {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .party-group {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 220px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--caution);
    padding: 8px 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .party-group.dragover { border-top-color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue-dim); }
  .party-group.offscreen { border-top-color: var(--dim); opacity: 0.85; }
  .party-group-name {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--bright);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .party-group-name input {
    font: inherit;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--bright);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .party-group-name input:focus { outline: 1px dashed var(--caution); }
  .party-group-remove {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--dim);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }
  .party-group-remove:hover { color: var(--red); }
  .party-members {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    min-height: 40px;
  }
  .person {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    padding: 5px 8px;
    cursor: grab;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .person.pc { border-left-color: var(--green); }
  .person.npc-ally { border-left-color: var(--blue); }
  .person.npc-hostile { border-left-color: var(--red); }
  .person.npc-neutral { border-left-color: var(--amber); }
  .person:active { cursor: grabbing; opacity: 0.6; }
  .person.dragging { opacity: 0.4; }
  .person-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .person-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bright);
  }
  .person-role {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .person-voice {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .person-detail {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .person.expanded .person-detail { display: block; }
  .person-detail-row { margin-top: 2px; }
  .person-detail-row .label {
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }
  .person-detail input,
  .person-detail textarea {
    width: 100%;
    font: inherit;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 2px 4px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    resize: vertical;
  }
  .person-add {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border);
    color: var(--dim);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .person-add:hover { border-color: var(--caution); color: var(--text); }

  /* ===== SESSION WORKFLOW BANNER ===== */
  .workflow-banner {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--caution);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .workflow-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    min-width: 220px;
  }

  .reset-step {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--caution);
  }

  .loop-step {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--cyan);
  }

  .step-label {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--bright);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .step-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .step-item {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .step-arrow {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .workflow-divider {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* ===== TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT ===== */
  .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 50px);
  }

  .main {
    padding: 16px 24px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .sidebar {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 14px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 50px;
    height: calc(100vh - 50px);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  /* ===== TRUTHS ===== */
  .truths {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .truth {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border: 2px solid var(--bright);
    background: var(--bright);
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* ===== PANELS ===== */
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .panel-header {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    user-select: none;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .panel-header:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03); }
  .panel-header .chev {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dim);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .panel.collapsed .panel-header .chev { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  .panel.collapsed .panel-body { display: none; }
  .panel-body { padding: 12px 16px; }

  .ph-red { color: var(--red); border-bottom-color: var(--red); }
  .ph-amber { color: var(--amber); border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }
  .ph-green { color: var(--green); border-bottom-color: var(--green); }
  .ph-blue { color: var(--blue); border-bottom-color: var(--blue); }
  .ph-cyan { color: var(--cyan); border-bottom-color: var(--cyan); }

  /* ===== PERILS ===== */
  .peril-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .peril {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--caution);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .peril-name {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--bright);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .omen {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 3px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .omen input[type="checkbox"] {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    min-width: 14px;
    border: 2px solid var(--bright);
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 2px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .omen input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
    border-color: var(--dim);
    background: var(--dim);
  }
  .omen input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
    content: 'X';
    position: absolute;
    top: -2px;
    left: 1px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .omen.checked .omen-text {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: var(--dim);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .omen.next-up .omen-text {
    color: var(--bright);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    background: var(--caution-dim);
    padding: 1px 4px;
  }
  .omen-text { flex: 1; }

  /* ===== OMEN OPEN FORMAT (communicates / examples) ===== */
  .omen-detail {
    margin: 2px 0 4px 22px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  .omen-detail .label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--bright);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }
  .omen-detail-row { margin-top: 2px; }
  .omen.parked, .peril.parked .omen { opacity: 0.5; font-style: italic; }
  .peril.dormant {
    border-left-color: var(--dim) !important;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .peril.dormant .peril-name::after {
    content: ' — DORMANT';
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--dim);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .peril-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 6px;
    font-size: 9px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    background: var(--caution-dim);
    color: var(--bright);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .peril-tag.parked { background: rgba(119,119,112,0.15); color: var(--dim); }

  /* ===== ENTITY GRID ===== */
  .entity-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .entity {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .entity-name {
    color: var(--bright);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .entity-tag {
    font-weight: normal;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .entity-want { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .entity-thinks { color: var(--dim); font-style: italic; }

  /* ===== LOCATIONS ===== */
  .loc-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .loc-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ===== SESSION NOTES ===== */
  .notes-area {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 120px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px;
    resize: vertical;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .notes-area:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--bright); }

  /* ===== SIDEBAR: IMPROV TOOLS ===== */
  .improv-section { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .improv-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .improv-label {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .roll-btn {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 2px solid var(--bright);
    color: var(--bright);
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .roll-btn:hover {
    background: var(--bright);
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .roll-btn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .roll-btn.primary { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red); }
  .roll-btn.primary:hover { background: var(--red); color: #ffffff; border-color: var(--red); }

  .result-box {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
    min-height: 42px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--bright);
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .result-box.flash { border-color: var(--caution); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--caution-dim); }
  .result-box .action-word { color: var(--red); font-weight: bold; }
  .result-box .theme-word { color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; }
  .result-box .plus { color: var(--dim); margin: 0 8px; }

  .descriptor-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .chip {
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .chip.fresh { border-color: var(--bright); color: var(--bright); font-weight: bold; }

  .name-result {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--bright);
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .sidebar-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .sidebar {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  /* ===== COMPLICATION ===== */
  .complication-result {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .complication-roll {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .dim { color: var(--dim); }
  .red { color: var(--red); }
  .amber { color: var(--amber); }
  .green { color: var(--green); }
  .blue { color: var(--blue); }
  .cyan { color: var(--cyan); }
  .bright { color: var(--bright); }
  b { color: var(--bright); }
  hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 10px 0; }
  ::selection { background: var(--caution); color: var(--bright); }

  /* SCENE DRESSING */
  .dressing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .dressing-item {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .dressing-item .dressing-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--bright);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
<div class="header">
  <div>
    <h1>Another Bug Hunt</h1>
    <span class="sub">Mothership 1e &mdash; Heron Station</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
    <a href="library.html" style="color:var(--caution,#e8c800);text-decoration:none;font-family:'Share Tech Mono',monospace;font-size:0.9rem;border:1px solid var(--caution,#e8c800);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:4px;">📖 Library</a>
    <span class="clock" id="clock"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PARTY COMPOSITION TRACKER ===== -->
<div class="party-tracker" id="party-tracker">
  <div class="party-tracker-header">
    <div class="party-tracker-title">Party Composition</div>
    <div class="party-tracker-controls">
      <button class="party-btn" onclick="addPartyGroup()">+ Group</button>
      <button class="party-btn" onclick="resetPartyTracker()" title="Reset to default">↺ Reset</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="party-groups" id="party-groups">
    <!-- Groups injected by JS -->
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== SESSION WORKFLOW ===== -->
<div class="workflow-banner">
  <div class="workflow-step reset-step">
    <div class="step-label">RESET</div>
    <div class="step-content">
      <div class="step-item">1. Pressures</div>
      <div class="step-item">2. Objectives</div>
      <div class="step-item">3. Challenges</div>
      <div class="step-arrow">→ Strategy → Direction</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="workflow-divider">→</div>

  <div class="workflow-step loop-step">
    <div class="step-label">LOOP</div>
    <div class="step-content">
      <div class="step-item">1. Challenge</div>
      <div class="step-item">2. Interactables</div>
      <div class="step-item">3. Local pressure</div>
      <div class="step-arrow">→ Solve → Next OR Reset</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== LAYOUT ===== -->
<div class="layout">

<!-- ==================== MAIN CONTENT ==================== -->
<div class="main">

  <!-- TRUTHS -->
  <div class="truths">
    <div class="truth">Everything is changing</div>
    <div class="truth">You will die here</div>
    <div class="truth">This will spread</div>
  </div>

  <!-- PERILS -->
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-header ph-red" onclick="togglePanel(this)">
      Perils <span class="chev">&#9660;</span>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <div class="peril-grid">

        <!-- THE CURE IS LOST -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="cure">
          <div class="peril-name">The Cure Is Lost</div>
          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">The Cure Has a Name</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>A cure exists, Edem was close to it, and the players know it's real.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>Valdez mentions it · scrap of Edem's notes · radio fragment · log entry.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">Signs of the Cure</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Shore is moving with the cure &mdash; she's putting distance between herself and the players. Time pressure rising.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>discarded medical kit · forced door · body she left · distant glimpse · security feed flicker.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">Omen 3 — pending</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail"><div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">TBD</span></div></div>
        </div>

        <!-- THE MIMIC IS BORN -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="mimic">
          <div class="peril-name">The Mimic Is Born <span class="peril-tag">2/3 fired</span></div>
          <label class="omen checked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox" checked><span class="omen-text">Carcinids Heard Nearby</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Fired:</span>last session &mdash; corridors, clicks, peripheral movement.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen checked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox" checked><span class="omen-text">The Procession</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Fired:</span>last session &mdash; carcinids streaming toward the mother + reactor shriek.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">The Radiation Returns</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>The mother is decomposing as the mimic forms. Radiation she absorbed is leaking back &mdash; the birth is imminent but not yet done.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>geiger spike from reactor direction · Tandy's dosimeter screams · radio static near reactor · symptoms of acute exposure on returning NPCs.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- THE HANGAR FALLS -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="hangar">
          <div class="peril-name">The Hangar Falls <span class="peril-tag">2/3 fired</span></div>
          <label class="omen checked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox" checked><span class="omen-text">Radio Goes Tense</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Fired:</span>last session &mdash; Brookman arguing on the channel, signal drops out.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen checked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox" checked><span class="omen-text">Brookman's Mutiny</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Fired:</span>last session &mdash; Brookman shot a soldier, stole an ATV, fled. Witnessed by Willis.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">We're Out of Time</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Hangar occupants are about to make a decision the players can't undo &mdash; last evac, full lockdown, abandon, scuttle.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>radio ultimatum (&quot;closing in five&quot;) · sound of a bird spinning up at the hangar · barricade going up audibly · last call by name.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HINTON ASCENDS -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="hinton">
          <div class="peril-name">Hinton Ascends</div>
          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">He Wasn't Where He Was Supposed To Be</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Hinton was acting against the colony's interests &mdash; off-mission, off-protocol, off-character.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Triggers:</span>where was he · what did he do · who did he leave behind or send away.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>duty log gap · order he gave that makes no sense · evac manifest with his name removed · door override · requisition.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">He Speaks Their Language</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Hinton is integrated with the carcinids &mdash; communicating, not fighting. He may not be fully human anymore.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Triggers:</span>where is the contact heard from · is it voice or shriek or both · do the carcinids respond to him.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>recovered comms log of him talking to nothing · carcinids parting around him on a feed · shriek that carries his cadence.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen parked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">Omen 3 — parked (won't come up yet)</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail"><div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Reserved</span> for next scenario.</div></div>
        </div>

        <!-- THE WORLD BREATHES IN (formerly Storm Closes) -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="worldbreathes">
          <div class="peril-name">The World Breathes In</div>
          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">The Wildlife Came In</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>The storm isn't just weather &mdash; it's pushing transformed life out of the jungle and into human spaces.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>strange insect on a windowsill · bird with wrong skin in a corridor · soft scuttling in a vent that wasn't there yesterday.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">Skin Remembers</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Storm exposure is doing something to bodies &mdash; visible, wrong, and not stopping.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>scale-pattern rash on an NPC · patch of skin that won't stop sloughing · someone vomits something that's still moving.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">The Whispers Start</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>The Shriek frequency is bleeding through into human cognition &mdash; the planet is starting to be heard.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>player hears something in their own voice · NPC mid-sentence forgets which language they speak · shared dream · radio static that resolves into a word.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- THE DROPSHIP LEAVES WITHOUT THEM -->
        <div class="peril" data-peril="dropship">
          <div class="peril-name">The Dropship Leaves Without Them</div>
          <label class="omen next-up" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">They're Doing Math</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>The pilots are calculating their launch window aloud &mdash; they're not threatening to leave, they're working out when they have to.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>radio chatter on weather windows · pilot asking how long the team needs · fuel/storm tradeoff said over comms.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">They're Spinning Up</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Preflight has begun. They've decided. This is committed action, not a warning.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>distant turbines audible · hot light on a control panel feed · a pilot's voice quieter, flatter, busy.</div>
          </div>

          <label class="omen" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">Last Call</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Communicates:</span>Hard deadline. The next thing the players hear from this peril is engines or silence.</div>
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Examples:</span>named callout (&quot;Willis, where are you&quot;) · countdown · an apology · the channel switching to emergency band.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MAAS TRANSFORMS — DORMANT -->
        <div class="peril dormant" data-peril="maas">
          <div class="peril-name">Maas Transforms</div>
          <label class="omen parked" onclick="updateOmens(this)">
            <input type="checkbox"><span class="omen-text">No foreshadowing</span>
          </label>
          <div class="omen-detail">
            <div class="omen-detail-row"><span class="label">Reserved:</span>campaign closer, one-shot reveal &mdash; deliberately no breadcrumbs.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ENTITIES -->
  <div class="panel">
